@startuml
title UML states - statement version objects, retrieval references and legal holds
state "Statement month" as M {
 [*] --> NotReady : month open or periodic finality pending
 NotReady --> NotReady : refusal recorded; nothing published
 NotReady --> Published : readiness satisfied
}
state "Version object" as V {
 [*] --> Current : first ready snapshot
 Current --> Superseded : later snapshot differs
 Current --> Disposed : retention ended, no active hold
 Superseded --> Disposed : retention ended, no active hold
 Disposed --> [*] : tombstone + evidence retained
}
note bottom of V
Not ready months publish nothing.
Closed-month totals never change between versions
unless a backdated source fact is detected (SOURCE_CHANGED).
end note
state "Single-use reference" as L {
 [*] --> Granted : owner or role recheck; 2 minutes
 Granted --> Consumed : same actor, current authority, object digest
 Granted --> Expired : clock passes expiry
 Consumed --> [*] : reuse denied (ALREADY_USED)
 Expired --> [*] : reuse denied (EXPIRED)
}
state "Legal hold" as H {
 [*] --> Active : records officer + idempotency key
 Active --> Released : different records approver
 Released --> [*]
}
@enduml
